# Not needed to build the site. The two largest files in the repository are both
# here — the scan of the original page, and the master of the summary figure,
# whose deployed copy is site/assets/how-the-model-works.png — so excluding this
# directory keeps them from being uploaded twice.

# The translated chapter, the scan of Figure 2.1 and the master of the summary
# figure: provenance, not input.
source/

# The archival JSON. engine/generate.mjs writes this directory, and creates it
# if it is absent; the page itself loads site/data/*.js, which the same script
# writes. Nothing in the build reads data/.
data/

# Development-time only.
.claude/
